    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "A binary operation * is defined by a * b = 2a - b. Find 5 * 3."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Think first: The number on the left of the star is doubled, and the number on the right is subtracted."
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "storagePath": "assets/question_visuals/p057_q04.jpg",
      "altText": "Source visual for edmar-csec-p057-q04 from workbook page 57."
    }
